81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (The objectives of SmartRoute AI are as follows. First, to train a DRL agent that assigns incoming orders to suitable delivery partners in a dynamic environment. Second, to include risk factors, namely congestion, delayed delivery, excessive travel distance and partner workload, in the decision process. Third, to use the Hungarian Algorithm as a baseline so that the learned policy can be compared with a well-known optimisation method. Fourth, to provide an explainable AI layer that gives the reason for each assignment. Finally, to reduce delivery delays, travel distance and operational risk while improving partner utilisation, using a simulation environment that needs no physical hardware.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
