115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 51 0 R
/T (Training and evaluation use a software simulator, so no physical hardware is required. The simulator generates orders over time, places delivery partners on a city map, applies time-varying traffic multipliers to travel times and records deadlines and completions. The environment follows the standard Gym interface [17], and the agent is planned in Python with PyTorch [18] and a reinforcement learning library such as Stable-Baselines3 [19]. All simulated data is labelled as simulated, and the framework is intended to be tested later with real traffic and order data.)
/E (Training and evaluation use a software simulator, so no physical hardware is required. The simulator generates orders over time, places delivery partners on a city map, applies time-varying traffic multipliers to travel times and records deadlines and completions. The environment follows the standard Gym interface [17], and the agent is planned in Python with PyTorch [18] and a reinforcement learning library such as Stable-Baselines3 [19]. All simulated data is labelled as simulated, and the framework is intended to be tested later with real traffic and order data.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
