/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 53 0 R
/T (This paper proposed SmartRoute AI, an explainable and risk-aware deep reinforcement learning framework for dynamic last-mile delivery assignment. The framework lets an agent learn to assign orders to delivery partners while considering traffic, distance, deadlines, risk and workload, compares its decisions with the Hungarian Algorithm and explains each assignment in plain language.)
/E (This paper proposed SmartRoute AI, an explainable and risk-aware deep reinforcement learning framework for dynamic last-mile delivery assignment. The framework lets an agent learn to assign orders to delivery partners while considering traffic, distance, deadlines, risk and workload, compares its decisions with the Hungarian Algorithm and explains each assignment in plain language.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [41]
>>
endobj
