278 0 obj
<<
/Title (This paper proposed SmartRoute AI, an explainable and risk-aware deep reinforcement learning framework for dynamic last-mile delivery assignment. The framework lets an agent learn to assign orders to delivery partners while considering traffic, distance, deadlines, risk and workload, compares its decisions with the Hungarian Algorithm and explains each assignment in plain language.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 223 0 R
/Next 279 0 R
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Title (Future work includes completing the simulation experiments and reporting the measured results, testing the framework on real order and traffic data, extending it to multiple cooperating agents and combined assignment and routing, and integrating it with a dispatcher dashboard.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 223 0 R
/Prev 278 0 R
>>
endobj
