>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Title (Training and evaluation use a software simulator, so no physical hardware is required. The simulator generates orders over time, places delivery partners on a city map, applies time-varying traffic multipliers to travel times and records deadlines and completions. The environment follows the standard Gym interface [17], and the agent is planned in Python with PyTorch [18] and a reinforcement learning library such as Stable-Baselines3 [19]. All simulated data is labelled as simulated, and the framework is intended to be tested later with real traffic and order data.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 276 0 R
/Prev 354 0 R
>>
endobj
