/Title (The framework has three layers: an input layer that supplies delivery requests, partner status and traffic data, a decision layer that contains the state builder, risk module, DRL agent and Hungarian baseline, and an output layer that produces the assignment, its explanation and performance metrics \(Fig. 1\).)
