/Title (Several limitations must be kept in view. The simulator is only an approximation of real traffic and order patterns, so results may change on real data. The reward weights affect the behaviour of the agent and need careful tuning. A learned policy offers no guarantee of optimality, which is why the Hungarian baseline is retained for comparison. These points will be examined during the experiments.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 356 0 R
/Prev 392 0 R
>>
