/Title (The expected advantage of SmartRoute AI is that the agent can adapt as traffic and demand change, whereas a snapshot method must recompute from scratch, and that risk and workload are considered together with time and distance. The explanation layer lets a dispatcher see why a partner was chosen, which supports trust and makes it easier to find problems with the learned policy.)
